<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 110,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 110,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estimated interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Tuesday were 110,000 head, compared with 106,000 a week ago and 99,000 a year ago, USDA said. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were firm, instances $0.50 higher than midsession Monday. Trade and demand was light to moderate. Offerings were moderate.</p>
